  "Theme": "Teema",
  "Theme, layout, subtitle and audio settings, speed limits. Off by default: subtitles sized for a laptop are the wrong size across a room.": "Teema, paigutus, subtiitrite ja heli seaded, kiirusepiirangud. Vaikimisi väljas: sülearvuti järgi mõõdetud subtiitrid on üle toa vale suurusega.",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Siin jagub ruumi vaevu ühele filmile. Ühenda karbi külge USB-ketas — FAT32-ks vormindatud, mida iga Androidi karp aktsepteerib — ja see ilmub üles, et sellele hoopis alla laadida.",
  "There is no folder at that address.": "Sellel aadressil pole kausta.",
  "There's no {file} in your documents folder. Copy one there and try again.": "Sinu dokumentide kaustas pole ühtegi {file}. Kopeeri üks sinna ja proovi uuesti.",
  "This connection is metered right now.": "See ühendus on praegu mahupõhine.",
  "This connection is not metered right now.": "See ühendus pole praegu mahupõhine.",
  "This copy wasn't installed by Ventic's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.": "Seda koopiat ei paigaldanud Venticu enda paigaldaja — vaid paketihaldur või ehitus lähtekoodist — seega uuendab seda see, mis selle sinna pani. Failide asendamine siit ainult segaks teda.",
  "This device couldn't start serving the film to the network.": "See seade ei suutnud hakata filmi võrku pakkuma.",
  "This device is called": "Selle seadme nimi on",
  "This device is streaming a film to another one right now.": "See seade voogedastab praegu filmi teisele.",
  "This device is streaming a film to {device} right now.": "See seade voogedastab praegu filmi seadmele {device}.",
  "This device is streaming the film to it. Leave Ventic running until you're done — closing it stops the stream.": "See seade voogedastab filmi sinna. Jäta Ventic avatuks, kuni oled lõpetanud — sulgemine katkestab voo.",
  "This device isn't on a network Ventic can see. Type the other device's address instead.": "See seade pole võrgus, mida Ventic näeks. Sisesta selle asemel teise seadme aadress.",
  "This device's decoder gave up on the file. That is usually the audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) and DTS are not licensed into the system webview, so a release carrying one plays as a picture with no sound, or not at all. An x264 release with AAC audio will play.": "Selle seadme dekooder andis failiga alla. Tavaliselt on süüdi heli: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) ja DTS pole süsteemi veebivaates litsentsitud, nii et sellise heliga väljalase mängib pildina ilma helita või üldse mitte. AAC-heliga x264 väljalase mängib.",
  "This file has one audio track.": "Sellel failil on üks heliriba.",
  "Timing": "Ajastus",
  "Tint": "Toon",
  "Title": "Pealkiri",
  "Too big for the download drive": "Allalaadimisketta jaoks liiga suur",
  "Top rated": "Kõrgeim hinnang",
  "Torrent engine offline.": "Torrentimootor on võrgust väljas.",
  "Torrent engine said {status}.": "Torrentimootor vastas {status}.",
  "Torrent engine said {status}: {reason}": "Torrentimootor vastas {status}: {reason}",
  "Torrents": "Torrentid",
  "Track {id}": "Rada {id}",
  "Trailer": "Treiler",
  "Trending": "Tõusuteel",
  "Try again": "Proovi uuesti",
  "Turn subtitles on by themselves whenever a film starts, in the language you pick here.": "Lülita subtiitrid iseenesest sisse, kui film algab, keeles, mille siin valid.",
  "Turns off the effects that cost the most to draw: the frosted blur behind the sidebar and menus, the blur on the background art, and the fades and slides that play as things appear or take focus. Everything stays where it was and nothing is hidden — it stops moving and goes crisp instead. Loading spinners keep turning.": "Lülitab välja efektid, mille joonistamine on kõige kallim: matt hägu külgriba ja menüüde taga, hägu taustapildil ning hajumised ja libisemised, mis mängivad, kui midagi ilmub või fookuse saab. Kõik jääb sinna, kus oli, ja midagi ei peideta — see lihtsalt lakkab liikumast ja muutub teravaks. Laadimisrattad keerlevad edasi.",
  "Two screens are merged rather than one overwriting the other, so watching something on one and something else on the other keeps both. Removing a film from a list removes it everywhere.": "Kaks ekraani liidetakse, selle asemel et üks kirjutaks teise üle, nii et kui vaatad ühel üht ja teisel teist, jäävad alles mõlemad. Filmi eemaldamine ühest loendist eemaldab selle kõikjalt.",
  "Type in the search box to find movies and shows.": "Kirjuta otsingukasti, et leida filme ja sarju.",
  "Type these into the other device when it asks. The code is what stops anyone else on this network putting something on your screen, so it never travels in a backup.": "Sisesta see teisele seadmele, kui see küsib. Kood on see, mis takistab kellelgi teisel selles võrgus midagi sinu ekraanile panemast, seepärast ei rända see kunagi varukoopias kaasa.",
  "Unmute (m)": "Lülita heli sisse (m)",
  "Unreadable": "Loetamatu",
  "Untitled": "Pealkirjata",
  "Upcoming": "Tulekul",
  "Update now": "Uuenda kohe",
  "Updates": "Uuendused",
  "Updates are checked in the installed app, not here.": "Uuendusi kontrollitakse paigaldatud rakenduses, mitte siin.",
  "Upload": "Üleslaadimine",
  "Use default": "Kasuta vaikeväärtust",
  "Use the usual settings": "Kasuta tavalisi seadeid",
