  "Using the usual audio settings": "Kasutatakse tavalisi heliseadeid",
  "Ventic": "Ventic",
  "Ventic TV": "Ventic TV",
  "Ventic asks a source for {movie}, or {series}, and expects a {streams} array back. Add several and their results are merged, with duplicates dropped and earlier sources preferred.": "Ventic küsib allikalt {movie} või {series} ja ootab vastuseks massiivi {streams}. Lisa mitu ja nende tulemused liidetakse, dubleerivad jäetakse välja ning varasemaid allikaid eelistatakse.",
  "Ventic collects nothing about you: no account, no telemetry, no crash reports and no server to send them to. The privacy policy lists every request the app makes and every permission it asks for.": "Ventic ei kogu sinu kohta midagi: pole kontot, pole telemeetriat, pole veaaruandeid ega serverit, kuhu neid saata. Privaatsuspoliitika loetleb kõik päringud, mida rakendus teeb, ja kõik load, mida see küsib.",
  "Ventic downloads the new package and Android asks you to confirm the install. It is signed with the same key as the copy you have, so it upgrades in place and keeps your library.": "Ventic laadib uue paketi alla ja Android palub sul paigaldust kinnitada. See on allkirjastatud sama võtmega nagu sinu koopia, seega uuendab end kohapeal ja säilitab su kogu.",
  "Ventic has no sources configured, so there is nowhere to search. You can still play a magnet or a torrent file you open yourself.": "Venticul pole ühtegi allikat seadistatud, seega pole kust otsida. Sa saad ikka esitada magnetit või torrentifaili, mille ise avad.",
  "Ventic hosts no content, indexes no content, and ships with no sources configured. It is a BitTorrent client with a player attached: it fetches only what you point it at, from servers you added yourself.": "Ventic ei majuta sisu, ei indekseeri sisu ja tarnitakse ilma seadistatud allikateta. See on BitTorrenti klient koos mängijaga: see hangib ainult seda, kuhu sa ta suunad, serveritest, mille oled ise lisanud.",
  "Ventic is MIT licensed. The components it is built on keep their own terms, listed above; on Windows the bundled mpv is GPL software and its licence and offer of source sit next to the application's executable.": "Ventic on MIT-litsentsiga. Komponendid, millele see on ehitatud, säilitavad oma tingimused, mis on loetletud ülal; Windowsis on kaasas olev mpv GPL-tarkvara ja selle litsents ning lähtekoodi pakkumine asuvad rakenduse käivitatava faili kõrval.",
  "Ventic is free, has no ads, no account and nothing to sell. It costs money to sign, host and keep running — a donation is what covers that, and nothing in the app changes whether you give one or not.": "Ventic on tasuta, ilma reklaamideta, ilma kontota ja midagi pole müüa. Allkirjastamine, majutus ja töös hoidmine maksavad — annetus katab selle ja rakenduses ei muutu midagi olenevalt sellest, kas sa annetad.",
  "Ventic is up to date.": "Ventic on ajakohane.",
  "Ventic searches nothing by itself. A source is a URL you add here, pointing at a server that answers with things to play. What a source offers, and whether you have the right to play it, is between you and whoever runs it.": "Ventic ei otsi ise midagi. Allikas on URL, mille siia lisad ja mis osutab serverile, mis vastab esitatavate asjadega. Mida allikas pakub ja kas sul on õigus seda esitada, on sinu ja selle haldaja vaheline asi.",
  "Ventic speaks the {protocol}. Any Stremio addon URL works here — paste the {link} link or the {manifest} address and it'll be trimmed to what's needed.": "Ventic räägib {protocol}. Siin töötab iga Stremio lisandi URL — kleebi {link} link või {manifest} aadress ja see kärbitakse vajalikuni.",
  "Ventic will send it the title you're looking for and play what it hands back. Only add servers you trust — this one is not run by, or checked by, this app.": "Ventic saadab talle pealkirja, mida otsid, ja esitab selle, mille ta tagasi annab. Lisa ainult servereid, mida usaldad — seda ei halda ega kontrolli see rakendus.",
  "Ventic {version} is out": "Ventic {version} on väljas",
