  "What a source has to speak": "Mida allikas peab rääkima",
  "What language the app is in, and what language film and show descriptions are fetched in.": "Mis keeles on rakendus ja mis keeles hangitakse filmide ja sarjade kirjeldused.",
  "What sits behind the app": "Mis on rakenduse taga",
